### Export everything as a backup file (groups, categories, account mappings, operations)
GET http://localhost:8088/api/v1/data/export

### Import a backup, merging it into existing data (the file wins on matches; re-importing is a no-op)
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/data/import
Content-Type: application/json

< ./wealthstack-backup.json

### Import a backup, replacing ALL existing data first
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/data/import?replace=true
Content-Type: application/json

< ./wealthstack-backup.json
